#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Tanimura"
msgid "So, you're Nadine?"
msgstr "¿Así que, eres Nadine?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Nadine"
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr "Sí..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Saki-chan"
msgid "He says he's here to help you, dear."
msgstr "Él dice que está aquí para ayudarte, cariño."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Nadine"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "¿De verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Tanimura"
msgid "Yep. Had a heck of a time trying to find you, too. Nice work."
msgstr "Sip. Duré un montón tratando de encontrarte. Buen trabajo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Saki-chan"
msgid "She's not out of trouble just yet. Those creeps have her\\r\npassport, and she can't get home without it."
msgstr "Ella no está fuera de problemas todavía. Esos hombres aterradores tienen su pasaporte, sin eso ella no puede volver a su hogar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Tanimura"
msgid "You mean... the human traffickers?"
msgstr "Te refieres... ¿A los traficantes de personas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Saki-chan"
msgid "I take it you've run into them already. Well, it's not only\\r\ntrafficking they do. They're in charge of managing the\\r\nwomen they bring in, too."
msgstr "Debo suponer que ya los encontraste. Bueno, no es solo tráfico que hacen. También se encargan de administrar a las mujeres que traen."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Tanimura"
msgid "Managing? In what sense?"
msgstr "¿Gestión? ¿En qué sentido?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Saki-chan"
msgid "They take the women's passports so they can't escape, and\\r\nthen give them just enough money to eke out a meager living.\\r\nThey're essentially modern-day slave drivers."
msgstr "Ellos le quitan los pasaportes para que no puedan escapar, y luego les dan dinero suficiente para vivir a duras penas. Esencialmente son esclavistas modernos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Tanimura"
msgid "Ugh... That's terrible. I hate bastards like that the most.\\r\nYou have any idea where they are?"
msgstr "Ew... Eso es terrible. Odio a los bastardos de ese tipo. ¿Tienes una idea en donde se encuentran?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Saki-chan"
msgid "In a dilapidated food warehouse on the docks."
msgstr "En un almacén deteriorado en los muelles."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Nadine"
msgid "I want go home to the Philippines..."
msgstr "Quiero regresar a mi casa en Filipinas..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Tanimura"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll get your passport back."
msgstr "No te preocupes. Te devolveré el pasaporte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Nadine"
msgid "You will!?"
msgstr "¿¡De verdad!?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Tanimura"
msgid "Yup. Just leave it to me."
msgstr "Sip. Déjemelo todo a mí."

